# oracle: displace_atoms move with atom-style variables on a group in a triclinic box, then velocity create loop geom: native remaps every atom and takes all coordinates to lamda and back, which sets the bits the velocity seeds hash
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box prism 0 4 0 4 0 4 0.6 0.4 -0.3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
group           odd id 1:256:2
variable        dx atom 0.04*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable        dy atom 0.04*cos(0.9*y-1.1*z)
variable        dz atom 0.04*sin(1.7*z+0.5*x)
displace_atoms  odd move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
velocity        all create 1.2 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe etotal press pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   norm no format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             50
